        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngabīji ntaale w'ilagane lyawiza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū būgima bo mihayo īyo tūlīyīhaya būlī gīkī, tūlī na Ngabīji Ntaale wa mbika yenīyo, igashije kū nkono gwa būlyo gw'isumbī lya būtemi; kwikūjo lya būsugi bo ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei alī ntūmami wa ng'wipandī lyeela no no no, na wa ng'wiheema īlo līlī lya ng'hana, na lya kūbeejiwa na Seeba ng'wenekīlī, lītī lya kūbeejiwa na munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose īkī būlī ngabīji ntaale akatūūlagwa kūlwa kūfunya shakwinha na shitambo, h'ī chene nū ng'wenūyū yalī īng'wigeleelilwe abize na shikolo sha kūfunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ni alī mu sī, ni atī ngabīji yaya, nguno balīho abo bakafunyaga shakwinha ūmo shihayīlile shilagīlo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo bakatūmamaga ng'wipandī īlo līlī shigemeng'hejo na shiikolanījo sha mihayo īyo īlī ng'wigūlū. Nguno ū Musa aho wahaya kwandya kūlībeeja ī liheema akahūgūlwa; ūwīlwa gīkī, “Ilang'hanage gete, būlī shikolo ūshibeeje gīt'ūmo ūkoolekejiwa aho ūlī mu lūgūlū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kilisito ī haha alī mu būtūmami būsoga no, nguno alī Nsangīja wa ng'wilagane lyawiza kūtinda, īlo lyīmīīlile ha wisagījiwa būsoga kūtinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī lilagane ī lya kwandya ūlū ni lyalī lītī na shilingo, ni yalī ītīho nguno ya kūkoowa ilagane lya kabīlī hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī akabona balī na shisembo akahaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
